150 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 60 0 R/T(Seoul's convenience stores are open 24/7 and packed with affordable snacks and meals. Major chains include CU, GS25, 7-Eleven, and Emart24\204found on nearly every corner. Must-try items: kimbap, instant noodles, rice cakes \(tteok\), and hot ready-to-eat meals. Grab banana milk, canned coffee, or a refreshing sikhye drink. Many stores offer seating areas, microwaves, and hot water stations. Perfect for a quick, budget-friendly bite any time of day or night.)/E(Seoul's convenience stores are open 24/7 and packed with affordable snacks and meals. Major chains include CU, GS25, 7-Eleven, and Emart24\204found on nearly every corner. Must-try items: kimbap, instant noodles, rice cakes \(tteok\), and hot ready-to-eat meals. Grab banana milk, canned coffee, or a refreshing sikhye drink. Many stores offer seating areas, microwaves, and hot water stations. Perfect for a quick, budget-friendly bite any time of day or night.)/Pg 16 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

