371 0 obj
<</Title(Hongdae is Seoul's ultimate youth entertainment hub, buzzing every night with vibrant energy. Explore lively bars and indie clubs along the main strip, or settle into a cozy pojangmacha\204a street food tent\204for Korean fried chicken and makgeolli. Drinking culture here is social and welcoming, with local favorites like soju and beer combos enjoyed at outdoor tables well into the early hours.)/Dest[17 0 R/Fit]/Parent 335 0 R/Next 372 0 R>>
endobj

372 0 obj
<</Title(Stay safe and plan ahead: keep your belongings close in busy areas and travel in groups at night. The last subway train departs around midnight\204check Line 2 schedules carefully. After midnight, take a KakaoTaxi or a licensed taxi from designated stands. Night buses also run through Hongdae until dawn, making late-night travel easy and affordable.)/Dest[17 0 R/Fit]/Parent 335 0 R/Prev 371 0 R>>
endobj

